type: article
title: "Sharp logarithmic concavity on balls and its instability under convex deformation"
authors:
  - family-names: Zweiman
    given-names: Henry
date-released: 2026-09-16
version: 1.1.0
url: "https://github.com/Hwzw/algebra-number-theory-drafts/tree/main/papers/P46-logarithmic-ball-concavity"
abstract: "A positive radial power series for the logarithmic Schrodinger equation proves sharp square-root-log concavity and positive power concavity on every ball. The normalized square-root-log property fails under arbitrarily small smooth uniformly convex deformations of every ball in dimensions at least two. AI-assisted preprint, not independently verified."
